  "statuteText": "135-C:52 Appeal. –\n\nA person whose conditional discharge is revoked, pursuant to RSA 135-C:51, may appeal the decision to the chief administrator of the state mental health services system. The person shall be entitled to a hearing on the appeal within 5 days, excluding weekends and holidays, of the administrator's receipt of request for the hearing. The commissioner shall adopt rules, in accordance with RSA 541-A, which shall include provision for legal counsel and procedures for waiver of the hearing."
